To be eligible for the FAPESP Post-Doctoral fellowship, candidates must meet the following requirements:
- Have obtained a PhD in a field related to the research project within the past seven years, with exception given to extended periods of training, such as maternity leave or serious health problems;
- Candidates should not have any employment relationship by Brazilian public, private or governamental institutions during the execution of the fellowship, except when there is a formal agreement between the institutions;
- Have a good academic record and demonstrate research potential.

